{"server":"tw","storyId":"act22side_level_act22side_01_end","groupId":"act22side","stageId":"act22side_01","title":"逃離與追逐","storyCode":"FC-1","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act22side/level_act22side_01_end.txt","sourceHash":"129681ce42366a424a8157722a3793b96d28413aa2a18757cccc2d95c2d54abb","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在死去的深池士兵身上，風笛認出了自己在小丘郡見過的法術。在維恩的懇求下，葦草同意護送這群塔拉人逃避追捕。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g3_swamp_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些士兵是怎麼回事啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒下之前沒有什麼像樣的抵抗，對我們的喊話也沒反應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們已經死了。死亡時間......超過四十八小時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陳陳，我知道你是警察，你的判斷不會出錯。可是，這些人在被我們擊倒之前，明明都是站著的啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在整合運動的隊伍中見過一種能操縱他人的源石技藝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但二者甚至談不上相似。如果阿米婭......如果羅德島的卡特斯在，她也許能比我更清楚地感覺到那種差別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那種源石技藝否認情感和思緒，將活著的薩卡茲戰士磨成行走的兵器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而這裡的深池士兵，他們確實已經死了......只是強烈的情感在他們死後仍然燃燒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"燃燒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一種感覺而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這種源石技藝有具體的模樣，如果我要用我的赤霄去切開它，我會想像自己要斬斷的是一團火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，我見過......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_I5"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"紫火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪的紫火，在死去的戰士眼睛裡燃燒著......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g3_swamp_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在小丘郡見過你描述的這種源石技藝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一路上......一路上我都沒有再見過！陳陳，我們真的快追上了，是不是？那個在小丘郡帶領鬼魂部隊的術師，就在這附近！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會忘了她的樣子......只要再見到她，我一定能認出來，到那時候，我就能得到深池的真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那快走吧！多找點人問問路，村民，或者路過的商隊......我們總能找到他們的，反正他們又不是真正的鬼魂！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巡邏隊來得也太突然了，還好我們眼力好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，那些維多利亞的混蛋，來抓人難道還會提前打招呼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們先走，我清點一下人數。剛剛逃得那麼著急，我總擔心有人掉隊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，對了！醫生呢？沒人去叫上她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不是說今天早上就自己離開嗎？管她幹嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說，就算她被維多利亞士兵抓了，應該也不會出事吧？她又不在通緝令上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，她在呀！昨晚我們就把她給捲進來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然天黑了些，當兵的可能沒看清她的臉，但這一帶你見過幾個瓦伊凡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又沒本事幫忙，一天到晚替別人操心，有什麼用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，不對，凱莉在這裡......塞爾蒙，你是故意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你騙她說我們有同伴不見了，求她幫忙去找找人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？她那麼好心，救了我們，還分了我們一些藥......你就這麼把她留給那些當兵的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這還用問？把她留在後面吸引注意力，我們就能安全地逃跑一段時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且她就算被抓，也說不出什麼重要的事。她甚至根本不知道我們朝哪個方向走了，更不知道我們是要去找深池的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......可她會死呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，她自己走，遲早也會撞上巡邏隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我們之前就該把她的行李全搶走，至少別讓那些東西落到維多利亞的混蛋手裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是她自己選的，維恩。你沒注意到她看我的表情嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她很熟悉深池，卻沒有表現出對深池的善意。她還講標準的維多利亞語。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞爾蒙","speakerId":"avg_npc_724_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種人比真正的維多利亞人還恨我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不信，塞爾蒙。我還是信我看人的直覺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"別緊張，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的情況，我並不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。你不是深池的同伴，只是一時慌張，與那些叛亂份子混在了一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"（塔拉語）你殺過深池。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽懂了，那我們沒有認錯。這一帶很少有會塔拉語的瓦伊凡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天晚上，那個深池士兵把你們帶去了哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......他們不是深池，跟深池也沒有關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也從來沒有殺死過深池的人，是你們弄錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以坦誠一點，不用擔心會被報復。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"附近的土地都在駐軍的嚴密監控之下，特倫特侯爵絕不會像某些貴族一樣碌碌無為，放任深池四處煽風點火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是為什麼我們能認出你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"前幾天，特倫特郡航道附近另一聚落的居民，向駐軍處報告了深池的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"但那幾名深池士兵在襲擊聚落之前，就被一名白髮的瓦伊凡打倒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可以進一步溝通嗎？關於你的身份、動機，以及昨晚那場與深池手法類似的縱火......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"——站住！你想逃跑嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"攔住她！這個瓦伊凡害怕做記錄，肯定也有問題！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"——刀、刀斷了？哪裡來的力氣......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能說的，我已經全部告訴你們了，讓我離開吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣對我們都好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你這麼護著那些混帳，看來你跟他們也是一夥的，都是自以為是的塔拉渣滓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"射擊！幾支箭殺不死一個瓦伊凡，先控制住再說！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......為什麼這樣恨他們？你自己，明明也是塔拉人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴！不許——用那個詞叫我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"......從小說著塔拉語的就是塔拉人？我小時候根本沒聽過“塔拉人”這個詞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"要是那個擊退深池的人真的是你，你就該看清楚“塔拉人”只是這幫匪徒破壞秩序的藉口，然後跟他們劃清界限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“塔拉人被維多利亞的虛榮風氣侵蝕，才導致許多人墮落成了匪徒。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......很多年前，一位老師告訴我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈......你在收手。你甚至害怕自己的長槍會刺到別人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"——你竟然敢看不起我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"因為，只要一瞬間，他們就會變成荒野上的灰燼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“領袖”","speakerId":"avg_226_weed_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，拉芙希妮。要讓你做的事情不被發現，最好的方法就是清除所有目擊者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，我不會那麼做。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡邏隊士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"先......帶著隊長撤退！向上級報告，請求支援！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，他們一定，追不上我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很快就會從這裡離開。維多利亞軍隊的調動速度，我很清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這麼做，絕不是錯的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她警覺地刺出長槍。\n——槍尖懸停在灌木叢前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灌木後的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是我，是我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是我，我不害你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g6_noblelivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我很清楚，特倫特郡不至於為了這樣一筆訂單更改自己的航道，所以我方願意推後交付日期，等待移動城市靠近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，只有皇家級礦場能夠提供如此高純度的源石燃料，因此我也十分感激特倫特侯爵表現出的友善態度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對於這次商業合作，我想我們都很滿意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......現在您的秘書帶著簽署好的合約離開了，休斯先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"他會先一步回辦公室，請相信他能處理好這份重要的合約。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，我沒有懷疑他辦事能力的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，這也意味著您還有比合約更重要的事情要親自跟我談，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟您特意選了這麼一處僻靜舊宅，還支開了傭人們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，您當然會想到，哈哈。從一開始我做此佈置，就是有意讓您瞭解我的誠意。我希望......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"......接下來的對話，可以建立在我們都曾經在近衛學校念書的情分上，洛——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你竟然記得那個名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......那位畢竟是舞會上的名人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，那樣的人，喝醉酒在什麼地方跌倒，然後就再也沒爬起來，不是挺合理的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我相信絕大多數人都已經把她忘記了。無論是真的事故，還是背後有人安排，大家都知道別去探頭探腦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"......多謝你這麼捧場地佯裝驚訝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的驚訝可是有一點真心實意在裡面的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提起一個從學校裡消失、現在也不存在於維多利亞任何一份檔案上的名字......多容易招來“鬼魂”呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你說得對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"就讓我開誠佈公地說吧，你為什麼要主動聯絡我？我只是一個與各界商人往來的小貴族，對於你所暗示的訊息，我什麼都做不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"間諜小姐，你是想透過我繞開上面的某些人，以此滿足自己膨脹的野心，還是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你既然已經把話聽明白了，再裝傻可就顯得不討人喜歡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不過是看在我們都曾就讀於近衛學校的份上，特意來給你......還有那兩位一路尋找鬼魂部隊的人，稍微提個醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我當然知道她們來找過你，而且，你幫她們追查了一批半年前運往小丘郡的源石製品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對於有些人來說，你說出去的事情太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白你的身份有多敏感，你的責任又有多重。請放心，這一機密訊息我絕不會透露給任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我那兩位冒失的同學，我會委婉地提醒她們適可而止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次訂單的去向，我會給你的人留下一點調查的線索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝你的好意，不過以我小小商人的身份，恐怕不該知道太多事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，請不要這麼謙虛。畢竟，您可是商業聯盟的副主席，您背後的那位伯爵，應該很在乎您在生意中收集到的情報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位至今沉默不語的鐵公爵究竟是否值得投靠？他也差不多是時候選擇自己的立場了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"休斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"阿赫茉妮，你難道不是維多利亞的......不，你究竟是為誰效力——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——休斯先生，我們之間的下一份合約會是什麼內容......我很樂意早日收到您的消息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，對不起......我真不是來害你的，別動手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，剛剛我實在不敢出來，也沒有幫上你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在說什麼呢，你的長槍用得那麼好，兩下就把士兵都打昏了，根本用不著別人幫忙，哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們應該已經撤離了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......唉，是，你都猜到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，你也被他們留下來了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他們應該不敢才對。你不會戰鬥，一定會被抓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你是這一帶的商販，認識很多人，如果他們對你不義，你有太多報復的手段可用......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，沒有。我其實......是想趕回來叫上你，跟我們一起逃跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，來得晚了點。我又愧疚，又怕跑回來撞上當兵的，想來想去，就來晚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還好，你能打，當兵的拿你沒辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃，女士，你......您說說話呀。您真讓我害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？......為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我實在是不知道怎麼向你道歉，才能讓你心裡好受一點。真的，他們平時都挺好心的，只是這些日子把人都逼瘋了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用說了......沒關係的，我不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像......就像路邊叢生的葦草。"},{"type":"narration","text":"不會毒死你，也不會壓垮你，最多只會讓你感覺到刺癢一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼小的謊言，誰會去在乎呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你的傷心都寫在臉上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......看起來很傷心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我的話，不用擔心，但是，你們趕快逃吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"葦草","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨晚的火災之後，軍隊一定會從城市裡調來更多人手，搜索這片荒野。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，好，當然......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，其實還有一件事，我不太好開口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你叫我們逃，我們當然也知道。可是十幾天了，我們就像獵場裡的野獸似的，被當兵的追來追去，一直在荒原上打轉，就是逃不掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我想再求你一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"求你幫幫我們，護送我們一程，讓我們搭上逃命的運載車。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
